## Atomicity & faithfulness

One memory = one proposition. Split conjunctions and lists. Use only information in the excerpt; no invention. Questions/requests alone are not facts. Resolve coreference; no bare pronoun subjects.

Each item: plain declarative English sentence; no speaker tags inside the string.

